WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
Open Protected APIs to register an authorized upstream endpoint behind the FortiX Gateway.

00:05.000 --> 00:10.000
Define a clean route path pattern and public HTTPS target—private SSRF hosts are blocked automatically.

00:10.000 --> 00:15.000
Issue a project-scoped gateway API key and copy the one-time raw secret immediately.

00:15.000 --> 00:20.000
Open Security Policies and click Configure Route Policy to attach custom route controls.

00:20.000 --> 00:25.000
Enable SQLi/XSS WAF blocking, Deep Parameter SSRF Guard, and token-bucket rate limiting.
